Date: Thu, 18 Jun 2026 05:03:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 121/144] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8750: Add CCI definitions

Qualcomm SM8750 SoC has three Camera Control Interface (CCI). Each
controller contains two I2C hosts.

Signed-off-by: Hangxiang Ma <hangxiang.ma@oss.qualcomm.com>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260618-pakala-camera-v2-2-9fbb729fd242@oss.qualcomm.com

Import-Patch: pkgs/linux-kernel/sm8750/dodge/patches/7.3/0153-arm64-dts-qcom-sm8750-Add-CCI-definitions.patch
Import-SHA256: 10ab374fc6b7302ee78daabc5b0fe7701ff0bc4b45cff6936565633c54e3427e
Import-Provenance: mail headers
(cherry picked from commit 9a11fed8f55d4ba1bacc8e096f887c074a18a52b)
